echnology</span><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">                          &#39;)                </span><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:navy\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:navy\">University of Canberra   ACT 2601 AUSTRALIA<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:navy\">Email:<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;\">bernd....@canberra.edu.au</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:navy\">WWW:<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><a href=\"https://researchprofiles.canberra.edu.au/en/persons/bernd-gruber\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://researchprofiles.canberra.edu.au/en/persons/bernd-gruber&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459470800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yje2OgjPRgMGE9K9_wk-z\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;\">bernd-gruber</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:navy\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:navy\">Australian Government Higher Education Provider Number CRICOS #00212K </span><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:navy\">NOTICE &amp; DISCLAIMER: This email and any files transmitted with it may contain<span> </span><br>\r\nconfidential or copyright material and are for the attention of the addressee<span> </span><br>\r\nonly. If you have received this email in error please notify us by email<span> </span><br>\r\nreply and delete it from your system. The University of Canberra accepts<span> </span><br>\r\nno liability for any damage caused by any virus transmitted by this email.</span><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;;color:navy\">==============================================================================<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span> </span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mailto:da...@googlegroups.com</a>]<span> </span><b>On Behalf Of<span> </span></b><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tessco...@gmail.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b><span> </span>Friday, 30 November 2018 09:15<br>\r\n<b>To:</b><span> </span>dartR &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b><span> </span>[dartR] Fst and Fis<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<u></u> <u></u></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<br>\r\nHi,<u></u><u></u></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<u></u> <u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\nI&#39;m working on a nice Dartseq dataset encompassing seven penguin taxa. I have completed most of my key analyses now, and have gone back to tick off some of the more basic statistics (global Fst and Fis).<u></u><u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<u></u> <u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\nI notice that many researchers generate AMOVA based Fst using Genodive... and I also note that you can import a Structure file into Genodive. My structure file that I generate with DartR does not work in Genodive, yet it worked in Structure (even though I did\r\n have to remove the loci names). I was wondering if anyone else has had this issue with this conversion from DartR to Genodive, or if there is an alternative software that is recommended to generate these statistics?<u></u><u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<u></u> <u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\nThe script I&#39;m using to generate my Structure file is:<u></u><u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<u></u> <u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\ngl2structure(glpenguin, outfile=file.path(&quot;~/Documents/DartR/penguin.str&quot;))<u></u><u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<u></u> <u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\nDartR works great for most other things I&#39;ve needed it for - and it came at a perfect time for me to learn how to untangle and analyse SNPs (thank you!).<u></u><u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n<u></u> <u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\nTess<u></u><u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif\">\r\n--<span> </span><br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to<span> </span><a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at<span> </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/dartr\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/dartr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459470800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QcyswACuOhCbazqwG9qVR\">https://groups.google.com/group/dartr</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit<span> </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459470800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0x1l5xUe8dpn3YQgpqORAJ\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:12pt;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important\">--<span> </span></span><br style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none